        "text": "Controlling the virus is a prerequisite for sustainable economic recovery.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "A sudden surge in activity increases the risk of viral spread.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The long-term costs of restarting outbreaks outweigh short-term economic gains.",
