    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83261.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "Well, it's great to have you with us. You recently had an op-ed Congressman Biggs in the Washington Examiner talking about how coronavirus has taken a toll on the American economy due to the amount of jobs that have been basically shut down right now. What kind of impact is this having and will it have on the country?",
