    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83261.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 25,
    "turn_text": "Well, President Trump said last week that he wants to reopen America as soon as May 1st, but that he would leave it up to states governors to decide when to open their state. How do you think states should attempt to reopen?",
