    "turn_text": "On that note, looking at a slightly different angle, many Americans are frustrated by the increased amount of government influence in their lives during this time. And for example, there is an incidence in Mississippi where some churchgoers were ticketed $500 after they attended a drive-in church service for Easter. Is this going too far?",
