    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83261.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "So if opening up is delayed further, for some reason, whether it's Democrats in Congress, who knows, or if governors of various states decide that they really want to take it extremely slow, what could that look like on a whole economically for the whole country if this happens at a glacial pace?",
