        "text": "For every couple of days delayed, the ability to maintain the economic foundation is weakened.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Six weeks ago, the economic foundation was very strong.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "People want to reopen businesses and return to work.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "If reopening does not occur this week, another 3 to 5 million people will join unemployment rolls.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Unemployment could reach 25 to 30 million, which constitutes depression-level unemployment.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Banks will face difficulties in the long term due to non-collected rent from landlords.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Landlords owe debt to banks and financial institutions.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Non-payment of rent by landlords leads to inability to repay mortgages.",
