    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83261.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 37,
    "turn_text": "So when America does, in fact, start to get back to work, what do you think the new normal, so to speak, might look like?",
