        "text": "Teleworking and remote communication will become more common in the new normal.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The new normal will involve fewer taxes.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The current trend of relying on government for solutions is problematic.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Congress will need to provide incentives to help businesses reopen.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "People will continue to wear PPE for some time during the transition.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Social distancing will remain necessary for some time during the recovery.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Not all businesses can operate effectively through telework.",
