  },
  {
    "episode_id": 83261,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83261.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 40,
    "turn_text": "Congressman, as you alluded to, some states are asking for bailouts from the federal government during the pandemic. What do you think of all these requests that we're starting to see?",
