        "text": "Governors have shut down businesses in the economy.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "States should become more self-reliant and manage their own affairs.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Governors have assumed significant authority during the crisis.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "A return to 'new federalism' is desirable, where the federal government reduces bailouts to states.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The shutdowns have led to reduced tax revenues compared to normal levels.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
