        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "A decentralized system of governance leads to better accountability and efficiency.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Undocumented immigrants do not contribute meaningfully to public finances and thus should not receive aid.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker holds moral and institutional trust in federal overstate power dynamics.",
        "confidence": 0.84
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 83261,
