        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a clear boundary between acceptable public health measures and authoritarian overreach.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Congressional members share the speaker’s concern about civil liberties and will act on them.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
